{"unit_id":"peach0x33a__dsh-open-browser#card-zh","repo":"peach0x33a/dsh-open-browser","commit":"7e78ddafe155f08c0cae48edfd782f1e60cafab8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-browser 是一个用于 DSH Web 客户端的后台插件：DSH Web 服务就绪后，它读取 webServer 的实际端口并构造本机访问地址，再调用系统默认浏览器。插件在 Loader 就绪后触发，也能处理操作系统分配的端口；Linux 无桌面标记时会跳过。它支持 macOS、Linux、Windows 和 WSL 的浏览器启动方式，可配置是否打开以及额外延迟。适合希望启动 DSH Web 后自动进入界面的用户；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44-59","lib/open-url.js:76-92","cordis.patch.yml:9-13"]}
{"unit_id":"peach0x33a__dsh-open-browser#card-en","repo":"peach0x33a/dsh-open-browser","commit":"7e78ddafe155f08c0cae48edfd782f1e60cafab8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-open-browser opens the local DSH Web URL with the system browser after server readiness. It handles the bound port, supports macOS, Linux, Windows, and WSL, and skips headless Linux. The open and delayMs settings control launching. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:44-59","lib/open-url.js:76-92","cordis.patch.yml:9-13"]}
